s, but generally a bit lazy. You can draw funny poses too if you want! ♡\n\nYou can put him in his normal outfit: https://refsheet.net/media/35580b0ee6fa1c44\n\nOr you can dress him up however you want! I trust your fashion! \n\nIf it's okay, please include it as a PSD file! \n\nThank you for reading my request, I'm thankful! ♡♡\n\nIf the amount is not enough, I can resend it or boost it! ♡\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/ZN1CEK5", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Codayama_3/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 394887, "client_id": 1026853, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a64f4101/uploads/origins/a396b85c-906b-41db-bead-7003912d361f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8579e70d43a0bc33d15afb79789e52f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a64f4101/uploads/origins/a396b85c-906b-41db-bead-7003912d361f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8579e70d43a0bc33d15afb79789e52f, https://si.imgix.net/a64f4101/uploads/origins/a396b85c-906b-41db-bead-7003912d361f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3cf28d0de9953e4a3ec0d6fcf31b93d4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a64f4101/uploads/origins/a396b85c-906b-41db-bead-7003912d361f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2367b63241e19ce80df5ef9d445726a6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a64f4101/uploads/origins/a396b85c-906b-41db-bead-7003912d361f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8227bd39a44ee95f9580a802dd0c8f53", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a64f4101/uploads/origins/a396b85c-906b-41db-bead-7003912d361f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8227